  "legal_principles": [
    {
      "principle": "The court's discretion in granting interim maintenance under Section 24 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955 is not affected by the wife's adultery.",
      "held": "If I were to accept the plea of Mr.P.Rajkumar Pandian, I would be judicially amending Section 24 of the Hindu Marriage Act and holding that the bar of living in adultery operates even for an application under Section 24 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955. I do not possess such powers.",
