      "principle": "The term 'other circumstances' in Section 25 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955 is wide enough to include living in adultery as a ground to deny permanent alimony.",
      "held": "The term 'other circumstances' found in Section 25 of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955 is wide enough to include the head 'living in adultery' also.",
